<p>Long, agonizing lines at the cash register during the holiday rush routinely cause shopping cart abandonment. Implementing aggressive "Scan and Go" technologies completely revolutionizes store flow. Customers simply scan the barcodes or QR labels of items as they physically place them into their shopping basket, building a digital cart on their phone. When they are finished browsing, they tap a button to pay via their digital wallet and simply walk out the door past a quick receipt-checking station, completely bypassing the traditional point-of-sale bottleneck.</p>

